{"tabData": ["1-50", "51-62"], "bookInfo": {"bookId": "41000118216", "bookName": "La pareja embarazada del Alfa estéril", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000118216/41000118216.jpg@w=360&h=640", "viewCount": 4977700, "followCount": 70190, "introduction": " Ella rompe su maldición de infertilidad, y él la recompensa con todo el amor del mundo y un sinfín de caprichos.", "chapterCount": 62, "labels": ["Werewolf", "Secret Baby"], "tags": ["Werewolf", "Secret Baby"], "typeTwoIds": [349], "typeTwoNames": ["Hombre Lobo"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 349, "name": "Hombre Lobo", "replaceName": "hombre-lobo"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Hombre-Lobo", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "La-pareja-embarazada-del-Alfa-estéril", "bookNameLower": "la-pareja-embarazada-del-alfa-estéril", "shelfTime": "2025-07-16 17:00:00", "firstShelfTime": "2025-07-16 17:00:00", "performerList": [{"performerId": "12045", "performerName": "Halle Fletcher", "performerFormatName": "Halle-Fletcher", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x4/12045/12045.jpg?time=1782296872602", "videoCount": 6}, {"performerId": "12199", "performerName": "Michael Joseph Nelson", "performerFormatName": "Michael-Joseph-Nelson", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x9/12199/12199.jpg?time=1790244229628", "videoCount": 2}, {"performerId": "12237", "performerName": "Bo Foxworth", "performerFormatName": "Bo-Foxworth", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/7x3/12237/12237.jpg?time=1762138895092", "videoCount": 1}, {"performerId": "12078", "performerName": "Rebecca Ritz", "performerFormatName": "Rebecca-Ritz", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x7/12078/12078.jpg?time=1762138931216", "videoCount": 1}], "performerIdList": [12045, 12078, 12199, 12237]}, "recommends": [{"bookId": "42000024753", "bookName": "Academia de Lobos: mi alfa prohibido", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024753/42000024753.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 50551, "introduction": "En la Academia Monte Negro hay una regla: jamás toques a Damián Espino, el heredero Alfa maldito. Pero cuando toca a Maya Colmillo, la hermana de su rival, sus marcas de pareja se encienden. Ahora Maya debe elegir entre la manada que la reclama y el peligroso Alfa cuyo lobo solo se calma cuando está con ella.", "chapterCount": 58, "labels": ["Werewolf", "Forbidden Love"], "tags": ["Werewolf", "Forbidden Love"], "typeTwoIds": [342, 349], "typeTwoNames": ["De Enemigos a Amantes", "Hombre Lobo"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 342, "name": "De Enemigos a Amantes", "replaceName": "de-enemigos-a-amantes"}, {"id": 349, "name": "Hombre Lobo", "replaceName": "hombre-lobo"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "De-Enemigos-a-Amantes", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Academia-de-Lobos-mi-alfa-prohibido", "bookNameLower": "academia-de-lobos-mi-alfa-prohibido", "shelfTime": "2026-08-25 10:00:00", "firstShelfTime": "2026-08-25 10:00:00", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "41000118896", "bookName": "Mi Luna Milagrosa", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000119654/41000119654.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 71524, "introduction": "Leire, una huérfana sin lobo se harta de la relación tóxica que lleva años soportando junto a Álex, el cretino de su novio. Completamente desilusionada, le deja y decide estar con Hugo, su segunda pareja. Por el camino, consigue despertar su lobo interior, se convierte en su auténtico yo, se erige contra los villanos que le hicieron sufrir y finalmente se convierte en la reina alfa.", "chapterCount": 66, "labels": ["Werewolf", "Destined Love"], "tags": ["Werewolf", "Destined Love"], "typeTwoIds": [349], "typeTwoNames": ["Hombre Lobo"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 349, "name": "Hombre Lobo", "replaceName": "hombre-lobo"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Hombre-Lobo", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "My-Miracle-Luna", "bookNameLower": "my-miracle-luna", "shelfTime": "2025-08-06 14:30:11", "firstShelfTime": "2025-08-06 14:30:11", "performerIdList": [12049, 12084, 12217]}, {"bookId": "42000027300", "bookName": "La princesa y sus dos alfas", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000027300/42000027300.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 23395, "introduction": "Tras un sueño que le revela a dos posibles compañeros predestinados, la princesa Zaira Valdés llega a la Academia Blackstone para huir de una boda arreglada. Haciéndose pasar por una don nadie sin lobo, busca pasar desapercibida, pero atrae a Máximo Cárdenas y Emilio Delgado, los alfas más poderosos y mejores amigos. Cuando el destino elige a uno y la tentación la arrastra al otro, Zaira descubrirá que el amor verdadero es mucho más caótico de lo prometido.", "chapterCount": 55, "labels": ["Werewolf", "Hidden Identity"], "tags": ["Werewolf", "Hidden Identity"], "typeTwoIds": [340, 294, 331, 349], "typeTwoNames": ["Identidad Oculta", "Romántica", "Triángulo Amoroso", "Hombre Lobo"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 340, "name": "Identidad Oculta", "replaceName": "identidad-oculta"}, {"id": 294, "name": "Romántica", "replaceName": "romántica"}, {"id": 331, "name": "Triángulo Amoroso", "replaceName": "triángulo-amoroso"}, {"id": 349, "name": "Hombre Lobo", "replaceName": "hombre-lobo"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Identidad-Oculta", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "La-princesa-y-sus-dos-alfas", "bookNameLower": "la-princesa-y-sus-dos-alfas", "shelfTime": "2026-09-16 00:00:00", "firstShelfTime": "2026-09-16 00:00:00", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000033664", "bookName": "Embarazada del Rey Lycan Sin Corazón", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000033664/42000033664.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 1646, "introduction": "\"Bella Miller, una estudiante universitaria arruinada, nunca pensó que una noche con el Rey Licántropo maldito cambiaría su destino para siempre.\nEstá embarazada. Y es humana.\nLas humanas no sobreviven al dar a luz a un heredero licántropo… pero si él quiere salvarla, tendrá que pagar con su propia vida.\"", "chapterCount": 61, "labels": ["Werewolf", "Student"], "tags": ["Werewolf", "Student"], "typeTwoIds": [294, 348, 349], "typeTwoNames": ["Romántica", "Paranormal", "Hombre Lobo"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 294, "name": "Romántica", "replaceName": "romántica"}, {"id": 348, "name": "Paranormal", "replaceName": "paranormal"}, {"id": 349, "name": "Hombre Lobo", "replaceName": "hombre-lobo"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Romántica", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Embarazada-del-Rey-Lycan-Sin-Corazón", "bookNameLower": "embarazada-del-rey-lycan-sin-corazón", "shelfTime": "2026-11-10 11:01:34", "firstShelfTime": "2026-11-10 11:01:34", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000010388", "bookName": "La reina alfa y su cachorro de contrato", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000010388/42000010388.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 3737, "introduction": "Después de \"adoptar\" a un lobo macho que se parecía muchísimo a su primer amor, la Alfa femenina creyó haber encontrado al doble de acción para su corazón. Inesperadamente, tras resolverse el malentendido, él resultó ser el salvador y amante que ella había estado esperando durante tanto tiempo.", "chapterCount": 69, "labels": ["Werewolf", "Destined Love"], "tags": ["Werewolf", "Destined Love"], "typeTwoIds": [349], "typeTwoNames": ["Hombre Lobo"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 349, "name": "Hombre Lobo", "replaceName": "hombre-lobo"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Hombre-Lobo", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "La-reina-alfa-y-su-cachorro-de-contrato", "bookNameLower": "la-reina-alfa-y-su-cachorro-de-contrato", "shelfTime": "2026-04-26 11:00:00", "firstShelfTime": "2026-04-26 11:00:00", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000027075", "bookName": "Atada a los tres alfas trillizos", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000027075/42000027075.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 24675, "introduction": "Nueva escuela, nuevo destino mortal. En cuanto Lyra llega, tres cadenas luminosas brotan de su cuerpo y la unen a tres hermanos Alfa. «Es nuestra», gruñen. Pero Lyra solo puede elegir a uno de ellos, y romper los otros dos vínculos significará desatar una guerra.", "chapterCount": 60, "labels": ["Forced Love", "Werewolf"], "tags": ["Forced Love", "Werewolf"], "typeTwoIds": [294, 349], "typeTwoNames": ["Romántica", "Hombre Lobo"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 294, "name": "Romántica", "replaceName": "romántica"}, {"id": 349, "name": "Hombre Lobo", "replaceName": "hombre-lobo"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Romántica", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Atada-a-los-tres-alfas-trillizos", "bookNameLower": "atada-a-los-tres-alfas-trillizos", "shelfTime": "2026-09-15 16:25:02", "firstShelfTime": "2026-09-15 16:25:02", "performerIdList": []}], "chapterList": [{"id": "596429517", "name": "第一集", "index": 0, "indexStr": "001", "unlock": true, "mp4": "https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/71/6x1/61x2/612x8/61281100014/596429517_1/596429517.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795204800&Signature=VTq29QIifonwIuWJF~-ZSZccOnJQTqIOeCrYdKaFou1n5NB0BoMkN-CWgRqwUBNzyJf-IHyWnEYRYFqYbxtwVJT6km0EAcUkMIqAXHBxbvOc8jTBvzRxug4oNPYzKiO8Z5cW-kIxF2Iio7-vLJrXC0Cw7Y0ihNjlbSUwCQFyGRw1giB48NrSXRkaopoM1zvmB~ctDiEQll8bQ0eFnaXf8-5QCrTE64~7fTI4i8AEb5UIWDYNd6-kJkngKYnW8IsXsSd6cwHidsGuTebz-gkSZjKh8aWDGbjNbrUvyg9hOSoIgtcqZbTdzOXeXgu71t65QHD9nEHynY5E~qrbZVbBVQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V", "m3u8Flag": false, "cover": "https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/71/6x1/61x2/612x8/61281100014/596429517_1/596429517.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135", "utime": "2026-06-28", "chapterPrice": 0, "duration": 158835, "new": false}, {"id": "596429518", "name": "第二集", "index": 1, "indexStr": "002", "u